  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_7ff3" name="Following successful order placement and confirmation, customers are prompted to transition into ongoing service via subscription sign-up, thereby triggering Process B.&#10;&#10;Subscription management process (roles: customer, system, support team; activities: subscription sign-up, cancellation request processing; decision points: subscription cancellation, refund/charge application):&#10;- Start: Customer initiates subscription sign-up.&#10;- System: Create account and access; set billing cycle; send welcome/terms.&#10;- Customer: Provide personal and payment information; confirm agreement.&#10;- System: Activate subscription; schedule recurring billing; deliver ongoing updates/enhancements.&#10;- Customer: Receives regular updates; may submit cancellation request at any time.&#10;- Decision: Is cancellation requested?&#10;  - If yes:&#10;    - Support team: Process cancellation request; verify terms.&#10;    - Decision: Refund or additional charge applicable?&#10;      - If yes: System applies refund or additional charge; settles final account balance.&#10;      - If no: System proceeds without financial adjustment.&#10;    - System: Deactivate subscription; disable access; confirm closure to customer.&#10;    - End: Subscription deactivated and final balance settled.&#10;  - If no: Continue subscription billing and service until cancellation or expiration." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_ExclusiveGateway_3" targetRef="Bridge_3_7ff3" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_7ff3" targetRef="atom_3_Task_10" /><bpmn:extensionElements />
